hyprland-plugins for Debian Duke
------------------

This package contains a build of the plugin repository `hyprland-plugins`, matched to hyprland.
To use it, run `hyprpm add hyprland-plugins` once to set it up (analogous to `hyprpm add https://github.com/hyprwm/hyprland-plugins`).
Then, enable one of the plugins contained.

Note that on every plugin update, you need to run `hyprpm update` to activate the update.
Plugins are also updated on every Hyprland update, since plugins are built for a particular version of Hyprland.
